sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as llm-d Client
    participant PredSvc as prediction-service<br/>80/TCP ClusterIP
    participant Pred as prediction-server<br/>8001/TCP HTTP
    participant Disk as /local_models<br/>emptyDir
    participant TrainSvc as training-service<br/>8000/TCP ClusterIP
    participant Train as training-server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant ModelDir as /models<br/>Artifact Store

    Note over Client,ModelDir: Flow 1 – Prediction Request
    Client->>PredSvc: POST /predict (HTTP, no auth)
    PredSvc->>Pred: Forward 80→8001
    Pred->>Disk: Load joblib model
    Disk-->>Pred: TTFT + TPOT models
    Pred-->>PredSvc: JSON prediction response
    PredSvc-->>Client: HTTP 200

    Note over Client,ModelDir: Flow 2 – Model Training & Distribution
    Client->>TrainSvc: POST /add_training_data_bulk (HTTP, no auth)
    TrainSvc->>Train: Forward 8000→8000
    Train->>Train: Retrain models (periodic)
    Train->>ModelDir: Persist joblib artifacts
    ModelDir-->>Train: Write confirmed

    Note over Pred,Train: Prediction pod model sync (periodic poll)
    Pred->>TrainSvc: GET /model/download/info (HTTP, no auth)
    TrainSvc->>Train: Forward
    Train-->>Pred: Model metadata (version, size)
    Pred->>TrainSvc: GET /model/{name}/download (HTTP, no auth)
    TrainSvc->>Train: Forward
    Train->>ModelDir: Read artifact
    ModelDir-->>Train: joblib file
    Train-->>Pred: Model artifact stream
    Pred->>Disk: Atomic file replace<br/>(temp write → rename)
    Pred->>Pred: Validate & load model
